Word.ia - word search solver
GROUP PROJECT

#Use : 

Clone the repository and then write make


To run the program: type ./Word_ia then,you can load whatever grid
image you want with the Button "Load Image" and there is many button that are
clear to detect like the preprocess and rotate ...

In order to test the save_word do:
./save_word [image path] [output directory]

As we did not finished the neural network, so we could not recognize letter
we must use txt files with the letters of the grid and the list of word :

Do ./get_coordinates [grid txt files] [list of word txt files]
then ./detect_pos [images/ image_path]
then ./paint_result coordinates.txt

#Information : 
grid1.txt and list1.txt correspond to image level 1
grid2.txt and list2.txt correspond to image level 2


